          "title": "Sign out in Settings",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Chat</strong>, then the gear at the top of Chats, then <strong>Sign out of Matrix</strong>. It acts at once and removes your messages from this phone.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/39681fb11439f5b0.webp",
