            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Signed out",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The chat offers <strong>Sign in</strong> again, and Chat leaves the thumb bar. Signing in asks for your recovery key, so keep it at hand.</p>",
